  "questions": [
    {
      "questionId": "q1062-decimal-square-proof",
      "geometry": {
        "left": 16,
        "right": 359,
        "width": 343,
        "height": 392.453125
      },
      "scrollRegions": [
        {
          "region": "stem",
          "client": 343,
          "scroll": 343,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 16,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 139.3125,
          "text": "一个两位数的十位数字为 \n𝑛\nn、个位数字为 \n5\n5，其中 \n𝑛\n∈\n{\n1\n,\n2\n,\n…\n,\n9\n}\nn∈{1,2,…,9}。把 \n𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\nn(n+1) 后面添写 \n25\n25 可以得到这个数的平方。哪条等式链能证明这条规则，即每一步等号都成立？"
        },
        {
          "region": "A",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "(\n10\n𝑛\n+\n5\n)\n2\n=\n100\n𝑛\n2\n+\n50\n𝑛\n+\n25\n=\n100\n𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n+\n25\n(10n+5)\n2\n=100n\n2\n+50n+25=100n(n+1)+25。"
        },
        {
          "region": "B",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "(\n10\n𝑛\n+\n5\n)\n2\n=\n100\n𝑛\n2\n+\n100\n𝑛\n+\n5\n=\n100\n𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n+\n25\n(10n+5)\n2\n=100n\n2\n+100n+5=100n(n+1)+25。"
        },
        {
          "region": "C",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "(\n10\n𝑛\n+\n5\n)\n2\n=\n100\n𝑛\n2\n+\n100\n𝑛\n+\n25\n=\n100\n𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n+\n25\n(10n+5)\n2\n=100n\n2\n+100n+25=100n(n+1)+25。"
        },
        {
          "region": "D",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "(\n10\n𝑛\n+\n5\n)\n2\n=\n(\n10\n𝑛\n)\n2\n+\n5\n2\n=\n100\n𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n+\n25\n(10n+5)\n2\n=(10n)\n2\n+5\n2\n=100n(n+1)+25。"
        }
      ],
      "offsets": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "entireHorizontalExtentCaptured": true
    },
    {
      "questionId": "q1063-digit-usage-conditional",
      "geometry": {
        "left": 16,
        "right": 359,
        "width": 343,
        "height": 514.015625
      },
      "scrollRegions": [
        {
          "region": "stem",
          "client": 343,
          "scroll": 343,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 16,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 193.59375,
          "text": "一个两位正整数的平方用数字 \n0\n,\n2\n,\n3\n,\n5\n0,2,3,5 写出。数字的使用方式分别作两种解释：一、四个列出的数字都实际出现，不添别的数字；二、只限制数字取自这个集合，允许重复，也允许不出现全部四个数字。分别找出每种解释下满足条件的全部两位数。哪组完整结果正确？"
        },
        {
          "region": "A",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 75.28125,
          "text": "解释一：\n{\n55\n}\n{55}；解释二：\n{\n15\n,\n45\n,\n50\n,\n55\n}\n{15,45,50,55}。"
        },
        {
          "region": "B",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 75.28125,
          "text": "解释一：\n{\n45\n,\n50\n,\n55\n}\n{45,50,55}；解释二：\n{\n15\n,\n45\n,\n50\n,\n55\n}\n{15,45,50,55}。"
        },
        {
          "region": "C",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "解释一：\n{\n55\n}\n{55}；解释二：\n{\n45\n,\n50\n,\n55\n}\n{45,50,55}。"
        },
        {
          "region": "D",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "解释一：空集；解释二：\n{\n50\n}\n{50}。"
        }
      ],
      "offsets": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "entireHorizontalExtentCaptured": true
    },
    {
      "questionId": "q1064-reversal-sum-all",
      "geometry": {
        "left": 16,
        "right": 359,
        "width": 343,
        "height": 349.0625
      },
      "scrollRegions": [
        {
          "region": "stem",
          "client": 343,
          "scroll": 343,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 16,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 99.171875,
          "text": "把一个两位数的数字倒序后，仍得到一个两位数；这两个数的和是某个自然数的平方。满足条件的全部原两位数是哪一组？"
        },
        {
          "region": "A",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "{\n29\n,\n38\n,\n47\n,\n56\n,\n65\n,\n74\n,\n83\n,\n92\n}\n{29,38,47,56,65,74,83,92}。"
        },
        {
          "region": "B",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "{\n18\n,\n27\n,\n36\n,\n45\n,\n54\n,\n63\n,\n72\n,\n81\n}\n{18,27,36,45,54,63,72,81}。"
        },
        {
          "region": "C",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "{\n29\n,\n38\n,\n47\n,\n56\n}\n{29,38,47,56}。"
        },
        {
          "region": "D",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 38.390625,
          "text": "空集。"
        }
      ],
      "offsets": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "entireHorizontalExtentCaptured": true
    },
    {
      "questionId": "q1065-four-consecutive-square",
      "geometry": {
        "left": 16,
        "right": 359,
        "width": 343,
        "height": 358.8125
      },
      "scrollRegions": [
        {
          "region": "stem",
          "client": 343,
          "scroll": 343,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 16,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 105.671875,
          "text": "四个连续的自然数写成 \n𝑛\n,\n𝑛\n+\n1\n,\n𝑛\n+\n2\n,\n𝑛\n+\n3\nn,n+1,n+2,n+3。哪条恒等式能把它们的积加 \n1\n1 写成一个自然数的平方？"
        },
        {
          "region": "A",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n2\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n3\n)\n+\n1\n=\n(\n𝑛\n2\n+\n3\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n2\nn(n+1)(n+2)(n+3)+1=(n\n2\n+3n+1)\n2\n。"
        },
        {
          "region": "B",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n2\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n3\n)\n+\n1\n=\n(\n𝑛\n2\n+\n3\n𝑛\n)\n2\nn(n+1)(n+2)(n+3)+1=(n\n2\n+3n)\n2\n。"
        },
        {
          "region": "C",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n2\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n3\n)\n+\n1\n=\n(\n𝑛\n2\n+\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n2\nn(n+1)(n+2)(n+3)+1=(n\n2\n+n+1)\n2\n。"
        },
        {
          "region": "D",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 41.640625,
          "text": "𝑛\n(\n𝑛\n+\n1\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n2\n)\n(\n𝑛\n+\n3\n)\n+\n1\n=\n(\n𝑛\n2\n+\n3\n𝑛\n−\n1\n)\n2\nn(n+1)(n+2)(n+3)+1=(n\n2\n+3n−1)\n2\n。"
        }
      ],
      "offsets": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "entireHorizontalExtentCaptured": true
    },
    {
      "questionId": "q1066-digit-sum-square-proof",
      "geometry": {
        "left": 16,
        "right": 359,
        "width": 343,
        "height": 597.546875
      },
      "scrollRegions": [
        {
          "region": "stem",
          "client": 343,
          "scroll": 343,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 16,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 108.921875,
          "text": "一个 \n60\n60 位十进制正整数 \n𝑀\nM 恰有 \n30\n30 个数位是 \n0\n0、另 \n30\n30 个是 \n1\n1。哪段理由能证明，无论这些数字怎样排列，\n𝑀\nM 都不是自然数的平方？"
        },
        {
          "region": "A",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 75.28125,
          "text": "𝑀\nM 的数字和为 \n30\n30，所以 \n𝑀\nM 能被 \n3\n3 整除；平方数都不能被 \n3\n3 整除，故 \n𝑀\nM 不是平方。"
        },
        {
          "region": "B",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 108.921875,
          "text": "𝑀\nM 的数字和为 \n30\n30，所以 \n𝑀\nM 能被 \n3\n3 整除但不能被 \n9\n9 整除；若 \n𝑀\nM 是平方，平方根必被 \n3\n3 整除，从而 \n𝑀\nM 被 \n9\n9 整除，矛盾。"
        },
        {
          "region": "C",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 108.921875,
          "text": "𝑀\nM 的数字和为 \n30\n30，所以 \n𝑀\nM 不能被 \n9\n9 整除；所有自然数的平方都能被 \n9\n9 整除，故 \n𝑀\nM 不是平方。"
        },
        {
          "region": "D",
          "client": 306,
          "scroll": 306,
          "maxOffset": 0,
          "overflowX": "auto",
          "left": 52.796875,
          "right": 359,
          "height": 108.921875,
          "text": "30\n30 能被 \n2\n2 整除但不能被 \n4\n4 整除，所以 \n𝑀\nM 也能被 \n2\n2 整除但不能被 \n4\n4 整除；平方若被 \n2\n2 整除就必被 \n4\n4 整除，因此 \n𝑀\nM 不是平方。"
        }
      ],
      "offsets": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "entireHorizontalExtentCaptured": true
